."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The final saw Belgium take the lead on the opening leg, only to be passed by the USA’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/150639"} "Shamier Little"] " on the second leg. Belgium moved back into the lead at the bell, on the strength of a 44.01 leg by " [:a {:href "/athletes/140996"} "Jonathan Sacoor"] ". The USA was second in the same time as Belgium, while Great Britain was third and the Netherlands was almost a full second behind."] "\n\n" [:p {} "On the final lap, " [:a {:href "/athletes/145442"} "Femke Bol"] " had the baton for the Dutch team, and bided her time into the backstretch, seemingly running easily. On the final turn and the straight, she moved ahead to give the Netherlands the gold medal, splitting 48.00 for her anchor leg, as the Netherlands missed the nascent world record by only 0.02 seconds."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Netherlands"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NED"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NED.png"}] "NED"]] [:td {} "3:10.81 (2 h2)"] [:td {} "3:07.43 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "10"} [:a {:href "/athletes/150350"} "Eugene Omalla"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/145449"} "Lieke Klaver"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/150351"} "Isaya Klein Ikkink"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/145442"} "Femke Bol"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/150339"} "Cathelijn Peeters"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "United States"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "3:07.41 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "3:07.74 (2)"] [:td {} [:span